  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "きのみが　ねりこまれた　もち。ポケモンの　基礎ポイントがすべて　なくなってしまう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "으깬 나무열매가 들어 있는 떡. 포켓몬의 기초 포인트가 모두 사라지게 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "加入樹果揉製而成的麻糬。能讓寶可夢的基礎點數全部消失。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mochi contenant des Baies qui réinitialise tous les points de base d’un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mit Beeren gefüllter Mochi, der alle Basispunkte eines Pokémon zurücksetzt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La masa de este mochi está preparada con bayas. Restablece todos los puntos de base de un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mochi preparato con un impasto a base di bacche. Azzera tutti i punti base.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mochi cake with Berries kneaded into its dough. It causes a Pokémon to lose all its base points.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きのみが　ねりこまれた　もち。ポケモンの　基礎ポイントがすべて　なくなってしまう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "糅合树果的粘糕。能让宝可梦的基础点数全部消失。",
